      "main_details": "<p>CUSTOM WEAPON (Martial Bow - Bolt element)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Accurate</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Adds a +2 bonus to the weapon&rsquo;s Accuracy Check formula</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\"><strong>Elemental (Bolt)</strong><br></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Choose air, bolt, dark, earth, fire, ice, light or poison. The weapon now deals damage of the chosen type instead of physical, and also deals 2 extra damage.</li>\n<li><strong>Powerful</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The weapon deals 5 extra damage, or 7 extra damage if it is a heavy weapon.This customization is not available for arcane and dagger weapons, or for weapons with the quick customization</li>\n</ul>",
      "main_hand": "Dragon Piercer",
